### ==========================================
### 1. SCHOOL (/api/v1/school/)
### ==========================================

### Классы (Grades)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/school/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### 2. STRUCTURE (/api/v1/structure/)
### ==========================================

### Управление пользователями
GET {{host}}/api/v1/structure/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Оценки / Параллели
GET {{host}}/api/v1/structure/grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### 3. STUDENTS (/api/v1/students/)
### ==========================================

### Ученики
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/students/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Предметы
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/subjects/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Учебные группы
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/study-groups/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Расписание
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/schedules/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Календарные уроки
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/calendar-lessons/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Посещаемость и оценки
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/attendance-grades/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Оценки (Marks)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/marks/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Сообщения поддержки
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/support-messages/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Уроки учителя
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/teacher-lessons/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Домашние работы
GET {{host}}/api/v1/students/homework-submissions/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}


